---
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Refund and Cancellation Policy | Lonus">
	<main class="min-h-[85vh] max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-12 text-[#E4DCF4]/90 font-['Poppins']">
		<a
			href="/"
			class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 mb-8 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs text-[#E4DCF4]/70 hover:text-white bg-[#16141a] border border-[#4D465D]/60 hover:border-green-500 transition-all duration-150"
		>
			&larr; Back to Bio
		</a>

		<h1 class="text-white text-3xl font-bold mb-2">Refund & Cancellation Policy</h1>
		<div class="w-20 min-h-[3px] bg-green-500 rounded-2xl mb-8"></div>

		<div class="space-y-6 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#E4DCF4]/80">
			<section>
				<h2 class="text-white text-lg font-semibold mb-2">1. Digital Products Refund Policy</h2>
				<p>
					Because all products sold on this website are intangible digital assets that are delivered immediately upon purchase, sales are generally final once the digital files or repository access have been provided.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2 class="text-white text-lg font-semibold mb-2">2. Eligibility for Refunds</h2>
				<p>
					We want you to be fully satisfied. You are eligible for a full refund within <strong>14 days of purchase</strong> under the following circumstances:
				</p>
				<ul class="list-disc list-inside mt-2 space-y-1 pl-2">
					<li>The digital files are corrupt, broken, or unreadable, and our technical support cannot provide a working replacement within 48 hours.</li>
					<li>The product substantially differs from the description and preview provided on this storefront.</li>
					<li>You were charged erroneously or duplicated transactions occurred.</li>
				</ul>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2 class="text-white text-lg font-semibold mb-2">3. Subscriptions & Cancellations</h2>
				<p>
					If any recurring subscription plan is active, you may cancel at any time prior to your next renewal date through your customer portal or by contacting support. Upon cancellation, your access will remain active until the end of your prepaid billing period.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2 class="text-white text-lg font-semibold mb-2">4. How to Request a Refund</h2>
				<p>
					To initiate a refund or cancellation request, please email our support team at <a href="mailto:support@hatsalsa.com" class="text-green-400 hover:underline">support@hatsalsa.com</a> with your order ID, payment email address, and a brief description of the issue. Most requests are processed within 1–3 business days.
				</p>
			</section>
		</div>
	</main>

	<Footer />
</Layout>

<style>
	html {
		background-color: #0a0b0f;
	}
</style>
